      "nal President of the American Jewish Committee, has written President Bush a long letter containing his thoughts on the Arab-Israeli conflict and some ideas for our policy. Winter wrote you a brief note (Tab A) enclosing a copy of his letter to the President (Tab B). Winter's ideas are thoughtful and well-intentioned. A brief reply from you would be an appropriate way t",
