      "U.S. interest and a fundamental precept of our policy in the Middle East. Second, with regard to the dialogue with the PLO, our firm stance on terrorism remains in place. Indeed, we have used the dialogue to stress that there can be no return by the PLO to terrorism anywhere. Again, thank you very much for taking the time to put your ideas down on paper for us"
