      "I was prepared to give Congress the time to think this over and to allow Jim Baker one more meeting with Prime Minister Shamir. But it has become apparent to us that Israel's supporters are taking advantage of this time to line up Congressional support for providing the guarantees now and presenting us in the Administration with a fait accompli. I want to be as cl",
