      "LY. WE ATTACH SPECIAL IMPORTANCE TO ENSURING A POSITIVE OUTCOME AT THE FORTHCOMING OIC SUMMIT IN DAKAR IN REGARD TO THE MIDDLE EAST PEACE PROCESS AND ISSUES WHICH CONCERN IRAQ AND LIBYA. -- AS YOU KNOW, WE HAVE MADE UNPRECEDENTED PROGRESS IN THE PEACE PROCESS IN THE PAST YEAR. ARABS AND ISRAELIS HAVE STARTED NEGOTIATING DIRECTLY, AND MULTILATERAL DISCUSSIONS OF REGIONA",
