      "BEGIN TEXT: THE PRESIDENT WILL DEPART NOVEMBER 16 FOR A TRIP THAT WILL BEGIN IN EUROPE AND CONCLUDE NOVEMBER 23 IN THE MIDDLE EAST. HE WILL ARRIVE IN PRAGUE ON NOVEMBER 17, THE FIRST ANNIVERSARY OF CZECHOSLOVAKIA'S \"VELVET REVOLUTION,\" FOR MEETINGS WITH PRESIDENT HAVEL AND LEADERS OF THE CZECH AND SLOVAK REPUBLICS. ON NOVEMBER 18, HE WILL VISIT GERMANY TO MEET WITH CH",
