      "vide a good opportunity to talk to some experienced people about what is going on in the region, about what Mubarak and Shamir may have on their minds, and how we might best go about the next phase of our policy. III. PARTICIPANTS See Tab B IV. PRESS PLAN White House Photographer V. SEQUENCE You should begin the meeting with a few introductory remarks. I would the",
