      "TEES THE RIGHTS OF THE PALESTINIANS. THE PRESIDENT HAS MADE THIS CLEAR AND SECRETARY BAKER HAS WORKED TIRELESSLY ON THE PEACE PROCESS. 23. HAASS MADE CLEAR THAT AS SOON AS THE POLITICAL SITUATION IN ISRAEL SORTS ITSELF OUT, WE WILL PRESS AHEAD WITH TALKS. THE PALESTINIANS SUPPORT OUR EFFORTS AND THE PLO IS NOT OBSTRUCTING THE PROCESS. THE POLITICAL AND DEMOGRAPHIC FUTURE",
