      "THIS POLICY, HE WOULD POINT OUT THAT PROBLEM IN WASHINGTON. AZIZ REITERATED THAT A PUBLIC CLARIFICATION WOULD HELP. - --ARAB-ISRAELI 21. AZIZ STATED THAT DISSATISFACTION WITH US POLICY ON THE ARAB-ISRAELI ISSUE IS FOUND NOT ONLY IN IRAQ, BUT THROUGHOUT THE ARAB WORLD. THE ARABS WANT THE U.S. TO PRESS ISRAEL TO ACCEPT THE RIGHTS OF THE PALESTINIANS TO RETURN, WITHDRAW FR",
      "Y. ~END SUMMARY~ SOVIET JEWISH IMMIGRATION - DR. HAASS WARNED AGAINST A BROADSIDE ATTACK ON S. ET JEWISH IMMIGRATION TO ISRAEL, ARGUING THAT SUCH AN ATTACK WOULD BE SEEN IN ISRAEL AS AN ATTACK AGAINST ZIONISM AND COULD ACTUALLY SERVE TO BOLSTER THE DECLASSIFIED POSITION OF HARDLINERS AT THE EXPENSE OF THOSE ISRAELIS WHO WANT PEACE. IT WOULD BE FAR BETTER TO PER DO"
